{"id":"wb-4-135","name":"美岱召","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"美岱召","text":"美岱召（蒙古语：ᠮᠠᠢᠳᠠᠷ ᠵᠤᠤ，西里尔字母：Майдар Зуу），原来汉名“灵觉寺”，清代赐名“寿灵寺”，位于中国内蒙古自治区包头市土默特右旗，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。美岱召是呼和浩特地区的“八小召”之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%B2%B1%E5%8F%AC","revisionId":93285013,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93285013","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c3fbc7deef3900407fd87488.jpg","title":"美岱召古城全景沙盘.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BE%8E%E5%B2%B1%E5%8F%AC%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF%E6%B2%99%E7%9B%98.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/%E7%BE%8E%E5%B2%B1%E5%8F%AC%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF%E6%B2%99%E7%9B%98.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sunatnight","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNNM-472-002","width":320,"height":212}}